---
import SlideHeader from '../_components/SlideHeader.astro';
---

<section class="deck-slide justify-between relative overflow-hidden" data-slide-index="3">
  <div class="m3-glow-green"></div>

  <SlideHeader category="Introduction" topic="Welcome Everyone" />

  <div class="my-auto text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-4 relative z-10">
    <div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-high border border-white/15 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-black text-[#8AB4F8] font-mono">
      7.77
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight font-sans">
      Welcome Everyone
    </h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-white/70 leading-relaxed font-normal max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      « Strengthening national digital skills through accessible, hands-on, and future-ready training programs for citizens of all ages. »
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 text-center relative z-10">
    <div class="card-m3 p-4 bg-surface-container space-y-1">
      <div class="text-[#8AB4F8] text-xl font-black font-sans">01. Inclusive</div>
      <p class="text-xs text-white/60 font-medium">Empowering citizens aged 7 to 77 across all technical backgrounds.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-m3 p-4 bg-surface-container space-y-1">
      <div class="text-[#81C784] text-xl font-black font-sans">02. Practical</div>
      <p class="text-xs text-white/60 font-medium">Hands-on workflows, real-time collaboration, and project-based labs.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-m3 p-4 bg-surface-container space-y-1">
      <div class="text-[#FDD663] text-xl font-black font-sans">03. Nationwide</div>
      <p class="text-xs text-white/60 font-medium">Deploys digital skill centers and workshops across Algerian wilayas.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-white/50 pt-3 border-t border-white/10 relative z-10">
    <span>7.77 Digital Skills • Algeria</span>
    <button type="button" class="btn-m3 btn-m3-green text-xs px-4 py-2 cursor-pointer" data-deck-next>
      <span>7.77 INITIATIVE OVERVIEW →</span>
    </button>
  </div>
</section>
